        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "60bcf6fa-ed5c-5ff3-b253-1da0fd330378",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Simon Pagenaud, Simona de Silvestro\n- Events: 2011 Indy Grand Prix of Sonoma\n- Organizations: U.S. Customs, Amlin Andretti, FIA Formula E Championship, Australian Supercars Championship\n- Topics: visa renewal, driver substitution, racing career moves\n\nFacts:\n- At the 2011 Indy Grand Prix of Sonoma, Simon Pagenaud substituted for Simona de Silvestro.\n- Simona de Silvestro was unable to compete at the 2011 Indy Grand Prix of Sonoma because she had complications renewing her visa and U.S. Customs would not allow her into the United States.\n- Simona de Silvestro drove for Amlin Andretti in the 2015/16 season of the FIA Formula E Championship.\n- From 2017, Simona de Silvestro secured a contract to drive in the Australian Supercars Championship.",
